WEBVTT

01:56.240 --> 01:58.640
Su Chengcheng looks strong,

01:58.720 --> 02:00.960
but she's always taking days off
at critical times.

02:01.040 --> 02:03.080
Although she's taking days off,

02:03.160 --> 02:05.000
she can always finish her work on time.

02:05.080 --> 02:07.160
She made this proposal

02:07.240 --> 02:10.000
and assisted Dr. Fang Jin
in the data test.

02:10.080 --> 02:11.480
Rather than complaining about it,

02:11.560 --> 02:14.360
you should confirm the process
with Dr. Fang Jin.

02:37.240 --> 02:39.360
Fang Jin, we should go.

02:40.840 --> 02:42.200
I'm coming.

02:57.160 --> 02:58.640
Fang Jin.

02:58.720 --> 02:59.840
Fang Jin?

03:02.480 --> 03:04.160
Fang Jin, are you ready?

03:07.200 --> 03:09.640
Fang Jin. Fang Jin?

03:13.240 --> 03:14.560
Fang Jin?

03:16.320 --> 03:17.400
Fang Jin?

03:18.560 --> 03:19.840
Fang Jin?

03:27.280 --> 03:28.800
Fang Jin?

03:30.200 --> 03:31.240
Fang Jin?

03:35.920 --> 03:39.360
Is this the left one or the right one?

03:42.160 --> 03:43.440
Fang Jin?

03:51.760 --> 03:52.960
Fang Jin.

03:57.320 --> 03:58.600
Fang Jin?

03:59.720 --> 04:01.520
Fang Jin, what's wrong?

04:07.840 --> 04:09.120
Fang Jin.

04:09.200 --> 04:10.480
Fang Jin, are you okay?

04:12.640 --> 04:14.040
Did she pass out?

04:14.120 --> 04:16.000
- I'll get the key.
- Hurry.

04:20.800 --> 04:21.880
Fang Jin.

04:23.480 --> 04:24.560
I…

04:26.920 --> 04:28.440
I don't feel well.

04:29.160 --> 04:30.840
I can't go.

04:30.920 --> 04:33.600
Sorry, I can't go
to the launch conference.

04:33.680 --> 04:36.640
What's wrong? Let's see a doctor.

04:53.320 --> 04:54.360
Here's the key.

04:58.680 --> 05:00.320
Give her a break.

05:01.320 --> 05:02.600
Give it to me.

05:05.040 --> 05:06.160
You…

05:13.440 --> 05:14.720
What are you doing?

05:15.960 --> 05:19.320
It's not about her body but her mind.

05:22.960 --> 05:25.440
Do you mean she's avoiding
the launch conference?

05:25.520 --> 05:27.720
Su Qingli, since childhood,

05:27.800 --> 05:29.560
You've been a pretty articulate
and good student.

05:29.640 --> 05:32.400
You don't know what it's like
to be anxious and lack confidence,

05:32.480 --> 05:34.400
but please allow others to have emotions.

05:34.480 --> 05:35.880
Stop arguing, okay?

05:35.960 --> 05:38.160
Please talk in peace.

05:41.080 --> 05:43.440
Do you know how many people
are keeping an eye on her?

05:44.520 --> 05:46.760
If the management team loses faith,

05:46.840 --> 05:48.480
they'll resign.

05:48.560 --> 05:50.560
If the clients lose faith,

05:50.640 --> 05:51.920
they'll find new partners.

05:52.560 --> 05:54.680
If the investors lose faith,

05:54.760 --> 05:57.280
Fang Jin might lose her own lab!

05:57.360 --> 05:59.640
Fang Jin will never give up.

05:59.720 --> 06:00.880
She just needs time.

06:00.960 --> 06:02.760
What about now?

06:18.560 --> 06:20.440
- You can--
- No way!

06:20.960 --> 06:22.400
This is Fang Jin's life.

06:22.480 --> 06:24.400
I don't want to, and I can't.

06:24.480 --> 06:26.640
None of this can work.

06:26.720 --> 06:27.840
So, what should we do?

06:31.080 --> 06:34.040
I can talk to Fang Jin,

06:34.120 --> 06:36.280
and maybe I can find a way.

06:37.040 --> 06:38.440
Hey.

06:38.520 --> 06:39.920
I'm Fang Jin's friend.

06:40.000 --> 06:43.360
At this moment,
I know her better than you do.

06:46.920 --> 06:48.120
Qingli,

06:48.640 --> 06:50.680
let Chengcheng handle this.

07:22.680 --> 07:23.520
Fang Jin.

07:41.480 --> 07:43.720
My left eye is nearsighted
with 300 degrees,

07:45.040 --> 07:46.960
and the right one is 400 degrees.

07:49.680 --> 07:52.080
But I don't know

07:52.600 --> 07:54.760
which is the left one

07:55.720 --> 07:57.800
and which is the right one.

08:00.280 --> 08:01.320
It's okay.

08:01.840 --> 08:03.920
You can wear your glasses.

08:07.560 --> 08:09.400
Qingli prepared this for me.

08:10.720 --> 08:13.320
She said I look better without glasses.

08:14.200 --> 08:17.800
Do you think it's comfortable?

08:27.240 --> 08:28.520
It's pretty.

08:30.800 --> 08:32.480
But it's not me.

08:52.600 --> 08:53.920
Fang Jin,

08:54.880 --> 08:56.920
you're an engineering PhD

08:57.640 --> 09:01.840
who owns a lab and an R&D team.

09:02.360 --> 09:06.440
You built a company
and has so many patents.

09:06.960 --> 09:09.160
You've worked hard for 36 years.

09:10.040 --> 09:11.640
You can be yourself.

10:02.640 --> 10:04.360
- Move this away.
- Okay.

10:04.440 --> 10:05.280
Yes, right here.

10:06.160 --> 10:07.000
Bring the flowers over.

10:12.280 --> 10:13.160
Yes, that's right.

10:15.480 --> 10:16.360
Powder.

10:16.440 --> 10:18.320
Mr. Gu, Su Chengcheng sent an e-mail,

10:18.400 --> 10:20.080
saying the layouts
and processes are changed.

10:24.800 --> 10:28.040
TBC, RED MIST AIR CUSHION
NEW PRODUCT LAUNCH CONFERENCE, ENTRANCE

10:38.800 --> 10:40.320
Why are you still here?

10:42.560 --> 10:43.600
Tang Qi.

10:44.880 --> 10:46.720
Would you be anxious and lack confidence?

10:49.720 --> 10:52.360
You're good-looking, so you're
not anxious about appearance.

10:52.440 --> 10:54.440
You came from a top university
and got a decent job,

10:54.520 --> 10:56.120
so you're not anxious about work.

10:56.200 --> 10:59.280
You're under 30,
so you're not anxious about age.

10:59.800 --> 11:02.840
And you're certainly not worried
about your relationship.

11:05.800 --> 11:07.720
People with a perfect persona like us

11:08.240 --> 11:09.840
are hard to feel anxious.

11:12.120 --> 11:13.720
But you're anxious right now.

11:23.880 --> 11:26.240
Serotonin. You need it more than I do.

11:46.000 --> 11:47.480
- Zhao Yunjie.
- Yes.

11:47.560 --> 11:49.360
Please stand here later.

11:49.440 --> 11:50.640
Fang…

11:50.720 --> 11:53.400
I can find the camera by looking at you.

11:53.480 --> 11:55.480
I'm new to live streaming.

11:55.560 --> 11:57.200
Please respond to me in time,

11:57.280 --> 11:59.320
like I'm communicating with the audience.

11:59.400 --> 12:00.920
It'll be easier for me.

12:09.640 --> 12:10.640
You like her?

12:13.440 --> 12:15.480
Fine. I'll get changed.

12:15.560 --> 12:17.400
Thank you, guys.

12:24.680 --> 12:26.640
If you like her, you should act.

12:26.720 --> 12:27.760
Good luck.

12:34.880 --> 12:36.400
All departments, get ready and be quiet.

12:41.480 --> 12:44.440
It's 11:11 a.m., a good time.

12:44.520 --> 12:46.640
And we're going
to release our new product,

12:46.720 --> 12:47.800
Red Mist Air Cushion.

12:48.600 --> 12:52.320
Now, I'm holding our new product,
Red Mist Air Cushion.

12:52.400 --> 12:53.880
Maybe you want to know

12:53.960 --> 12:56.960
how to tell whether a product
is effective or not.

12:57.040 --> 13:00.040
So, today, we're very honored
to have Dr. Tang Qi and Dr. Fang Jin,

13:00.120 --> 13:02.840
the developers of the air cushion

13:02.920 --> 13:05.040
and the elastic mesh,

13:05.120 --> 13:06.520
to answer our questions.

13:06.600 --> 13:08.920
Let's welcome Dr. Tang Qi.

13:09.000 --> 13:10.160
Hello, Dr. Tang.

13:10.680 --> 13:12.560
Hello. I'm Tang Qi.

13:13.080 --> 13:15.400
Next, I'll introduce
the main ingredients and effect

13:15.480 --> 13:17.320
from the powder's fineness,

13:17.400 --> 13:20.600
durability, and oil control effect.

13:20.680 --> 13:22.400
The main ingredients
of Red Mist Air Cushion

13:22.480 --> 13:24.920
- Will this work?
- are lipophilic small molecules.

13:25.000 --> 13:30.720
Our skin secretes oil when it's dry.

13:30.800 --> 13:32.080
The oil glands secrete oil for protection.

13:32.160 --> 13:33.000
I don't know.

13:33.840 --> 13:35.360
I just think

13:35.440 --> 13:38.000
that Fang Jin has worked hard for 36 years

13:38.080 --> 13:40.160
only to be herself.

13:40.880 --> 13:43.200
Fang Jin looks pretty
when she dresses up like that,

13:43.280 --> 13:45.320
but that's not what she really wants.

13:45.400 --> 13:47.560
If she can't be herself,

13:47.640 --> 13:49.840
what is the meaning of her effort?

13:56.280 --> 13:58.960
Dr. Tang, thank you
for attending this conference.

14:00.320 --> 14:03.480
Okay, next, let's welcome Dr. Fang Jin

14:03.560 --> 14:06.280
to introduce the beauty secret
of this elastic mesh.

14:06.360 --> 14:07.920
Let's welcome Dr. Fang.

14:10.200 --> 14:12.520
- Dr. Fang, hello.
- Hello.

14:12.600 --> 14:14.440
SHE'S A LITTLE NERVOUS

14:25.840 --> 14:29.320
Hello. I'm Fang Jin,

14:39.320 --> 14:42.160
a PhD in Material Science and Engineering.

14:44.240 --> 14:47.840
Since I was 21, I've studied

14:48.840 --> 14:52.480
materials for 15 years,

14:53.640 --> 14:56.360
focused on makeup tools for ten years,

14:56.440 --> 15:00.680
and studied materials to encase powder

15:01.320 --> 15:02.840
for three years.

15:02.920 --> 15:05.680
The material used to encase
the powder in the cushion

15:05.760 --> 15:08.720
is usually sponge or elastic mesh.

15:08.800 --> 15:11.800
Compared to sponge cushions,

15:11.880 --> 15:15.000
elastic mesh cushions
can better isolate the air

15:15.080 --> 15:16.440
and reduce the time

15:16.520 --> 15:20.320
the powder is exposed to the air
when encasing it.

15:21.600 --> 15:25.560
Okay. Dr. Fang, thank you
for your brilliant interpretations.

15:25.640 --> 15:26.720
It's worth a shot.

15:40.240 --> 15:42.280
Dr. Fang, thank you
for attending this conference

15:42.360 --> 15:44.000
and offering professional insights.

16:28.120 --> 16:30.480
You're so fast.

16:36.560 --> 16:39.320
I… I'm really fast.

17:12.640 --> 17:16.880
Su Chengcheng told me
about the change in her e-mail.

17:17.400 --> 17:18.640
Was it your idea?

17:21.480 --> 17:22.720
Yes.

17:23.280 --> 17:24.200
Why?

17:30.360 --> 17:31.400
Look.

17:40.800 --> 17:42.920
Do you know
why the rainbow is so beautiful?

17:44.160 --> 17:46.320
With abundant moisture in the air,

17:46.400 --> 17:49.120
nearly-round small water droplets
will appear,

17:49.640 --> 17:52.440
dispersing and reflecting sunlight.

17:52.520 --> 17:55.800
Rainbows are so beautiful
because it has different colors.

17:56.960 --> 17:58.440
If it were pure white,

17:58.960 --> 18:01.760
red, or yellow,

18:01.840 --> 18:03.680
it wouldn't be this beautiful.

18:05.440 --> 18:08.400
Those women who wear high heels, gowns,

18:08.480 --> 18:10.960
and pearl necklaces are beautiful.

18:11.560 --> 18:13.720
However, women in the cold labs

18:13.800 --> 18:16.400
are used to wearing shirts, trousers,

18:16.480 --> 18:18.840
and flat shoes,
but they're also beautiful.

18:19.840 --> 18:22.240
Just like the rainbow,

18:22.320 --> 18:25.920
the world can contain and present
all kinds of colors.

18:26.440 --> 18:30.400
That's why even the most common person
like me also finds it

18:30.480 --> 18:32.160
interesting to live.

18:50.400 --> 18:51.600
I like you.

19:02.120 --> 19:03.560
Sorry, I was wrong.

19:04.720 --> 19:06.080
It's not just that.

19:13.680 --> 19:14.880
I'm in love with you.

19:44.360 --> 19:45.440
Fang Jin.

20:07.800 --> 20:09.000
Did you see the bullet screen?

20:09.080 --> 20:10.320
They were so excited.

20:11.520 --> 20:13.520
Why did you follow Chengcheng's advice?

20:14.160 --> 20:15.840
Chengcheng understands me.

20:15.920 --> 20:18.560
She had a point.

20:19.280 --> 20:21.160
It seems the filter really worked.

20:21.240 --> 20:24.080
She became you and felt your world.

20:25.160 --> 20:26.280
Dr. Fang.

20:28.840 --> 20:29.880
Dr. Tang.

20:30.520 --> 20:33.960
I didn't get the chance
to thank you back there.

20:34.480 --> 20:38.200
Thank you for changing the process for me.

20:44.440 --> 20:45.920
Dr. Tang…

20:53.480 --> 20:57.640
You didn't reply to what I said
under the rainbow.

21:05.480 --> 21:07.240
Please give me some time.

21:07.880 --> 21:10.120
I'll tell you when I figure it out.

21:11.120 --> 21:13.200
Just some minor issues about work.

21:13.280 --> 21:14.480
Why do you need so much time?

21:16.040 --> 21:19.360
I'm being cautious to avoid mistakes.

21:19.440 --> 21:22.280
How about this?
I'll reply to you in half an hour.

21:26.000 --> 21:27.200
You're not her.

21:29.880 --> 21:31.280
Who are you?

21:33.720 --> 21:36.040
I don't know what you're talking about.

22:04.200 --> 22:07.640
Do you mean Tang Qi
confessed his feelings for me?

22:08.680 --> 22:10.240
He likes me?

22:12.080 --> 22:14.680
He said, "I'm in love with you."

22:15.360 --> 22:17.280
It's a deeper feeling.

22:19.240 --> 22:20.760
Why does he love me?

22:21.600 --> 22:24.840
Because I'm older and divorced?

22:25.360 --> 22:27.280
Don't you know
sister-younger brother love?

22:27.800 --> 22:31.280
Maybe he loves you
because you're mature and experienced.

22:31.360 --> 22:32.800
How's that possible?

22:34.200 --> 22:36.600
Fang Jin, in other people's eyes,

22:36.680 --> 22:39.960
you two are a good match.

22:40.040 --> 22:42.080
You both graduated from top universities

22:42.160 --> 22:46.600
and are very successful
in your professional fields.

22:46.680 --> 22:50.360
You're both wealthy
and have common topics.

22:50.440 --> 22:52.800
Yes. Nowadays,
young girls like the love story

22:52.880 --> 22:54.320
between two successful people.

22:57.640 --> 23:01.240
Back then, people thought
Guan Shengyu and I were a good match

23:01.760 --> 23:03.520
because we were both successful.

23:05.240 --> 23:08.680
They thought I was
well-educated and capable

23:09.200 --> 23:11.520
and had a good career
and a happy marriage.

23:12.040 --> 23:13.880
They thought I was successful.

23:14.800 --> 23:16.080
However,

23:17.560 --> 23:19.720
in that terrible relationship,

23:20.880 --> 23:23.840
I even thought I was unhappy

23:24.360 --> 23:28.080
because I was not attractive
or had a bad personality.

23:29.280 --> 23:30.360
It's in the past.

23:38.800 --> 23:40.880
I thought about it many times.

23:41.840 --> 23:46.200
Why am I so unhappy when I seem
to have everything?

23:48.280 --> 23:49.960
After all these things,

23:50.480 --> 23:52.160
I finally realized,

23:52.680 --> 23:55.600
regardless of your gender,

23:56.680 --> 24:00.760
you must love and respect yourself first.

24:02.760 --> 24:04.680
No matter what she looks like,

24:06.480 --> 24:08.520
what work she's doing,

24:09.320 --> 24:11.640
and what relationship she's in,

24:13.840 --> 24:15.640
she must be strong inside.

24:18.360 --> 24:19.480
That's independence.

24:21.440 --> 24:25.040
The happiness you earn by yourself

24:27.400 --> 24:28.600
is the most reliable.

24:33.160 --> 24:34.280
Chengcheng.

24:35.880 --> 24:38.680
I haven't had much contact with Dr. Tang.

24:40.040 --> 24:41.240
I think

24:42.640 --> 24:46.440
he's not in love with me

24:47.680 --> 24:48.680
but you.

24:56.920 --> 24:58.480
How's that possible?

24:58.560 --> 25:00.480
Tang Qi is so picky.

25:00.560 --> 25:02.800
How could he like me?

25:03.560 --> 25:05.520
Don't forget Su Miao.

25:07.480 --> 25:09.680
Even if what Fang Jin said is real,

25:09.760 --> 25:12.360
it's only because I'm using her identity.

25:12.440 --> 25:14.960
It's like he wouldn't agree
to change the plan for me,

25:15.040 --> 25:16.880
but he respected Fang Jin's opinion.

25:20.080 --> 25:21.120
Wait a minute.

25:22.800 --> 25:25.680
It doesn't matter
why Tang Qi fell in love with Fang Jin.

25:28.120 --> 25:30.240
The point is, he's found out
something is wrong.

25:30.320 --> 25:32.960
From Su Miao to Fang Jin,

25:33.040 --> 25:35.320
he fell in love with another person
so quickly.

25:35.400 --> 25:37.200
He can't be that serious about this.

25:37.280 --> 25:39.480
Maybe he'll move on soon.

25:42.800 --> 25:44.360
Hope so.

26:22.280 --> 26:23.120
I can't drink.

26:30.520 --> 26:33.840
Look how upset you are. Drink a bit.

26:36.920 --> 26:38.760
I must figure out something.

26:40.000 --> 26:40.960
What?

26:41.040 --> 26:41.920
The guard is chasing me.

26:42.000 --> 26:43.760
Help me knock him out!

26:43.840 --> 26:45.640
I… I can't!

26:47.840 --> 26:49.840
Fang Jin! Fang Jin, don't leave me alone!

26:49.920 --> 26:51.800
I don't know you!

26:56.920 --> 26:58.040
You're injured.

26:59.000 --> 26:59.960
If you can't walk, I'll carry you.

27:04.280 --> 27:05.200
I think there are two Fang Jin

27:07.360 --> 27:08.320
with different personalities.

27:12.120 --> 27:13.200
Finish this drink.

27:14.800 --> 27:15.920
I like you.

27:16.600 --> 27:17.720
I'm in love with you.

27:26.280 --> 27:27.840
I told her I love her.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.480
You were too bold.

27:32.440 --> 27:33.680
What did she say?

27:33.760 --> 27:35.400
Ten minutes later,

27:37.040 --> 27:38.720
I met her at the parking lot.

27:40.760 --> 27:43.040
Please give me some time.

27:43.120 --> 27:45.360
I'll tell you when I figure it out.

27:45.960 --> 27:48.360
I'll reply to you in half an hour.

27:48.440 --> 27:49.880
But she didn't know anything.

27:51.160 --> 27:53.360
She also agreed with me
that it was about work.

28:02.360 --> 28:06.040
Tang, if you ever had
a relationship, you'd know

28:07.040 --> 28:10.280
women will lose their memory
when they don't want

28:10.800 --> 28:11.720
to face something.

28:14.280 --> 28:18.680
Fang Jin just didn't know
how to respond to your confession

28:18.760 --> 28:20.000
and wanted to avoid awkwardness,

28:20.520 --> 28:22.720
so she pretended
that nothing had happened.

28:24.040 --> 28:25.080
Ridiculous.

28:26.680 --> 28:28.000
No matter how ridiculous this is,

28:28.080 --> 28:29.560
it's better than two Fang Jin.

29:19.080 --> 29:19.920
Listen…

29:23.800 --> 29:26.160
There really are two Fang Jin.

29:28.120 --> 29:28.960
Only two.

29:34.360 --> 29:36.040
One can make

29:37.480 --> 29:40.680
my heart race.

29:41.200 --> 29:42.040
I like her.

29:43.960 --> 29:47.720
The other is not…

29:47.800 --> 29:51.120
in my heart.

29:52.520 --> 29:54.840
I don't like her.

29:58.160 --> 30:00.200
Trust me.

30:07.720 --> 30:09.200
There are two Fang Jin.

30:11.880 --> 30:13.760
Two Fang Jin…

30:21.960 --> 30:23.920
I'll discover the truth!

30:26.400 --> 30:27.920
I'll prove it to you!

30:31.200 --> 30:32.280
Two…

30:36.640 --> 30:37.800
Cheers.

31:32.760 --> 31:39.200
SOUL DETECTIVE

31:50.680 --> 31:52.080
My son…

32:05.880 --> 32:08.840
Did I travel into my comics?

32:12.120 --> 32:13.760
This is my room.

32:23.600 --> 32:26.760
The main character traveled into my world?

32:45.240 --> 32:47.720
I know you have many questions.

32:47.800 --> 32:49.720
I know you're scared.

32:49.800 --> 32:50.880
But trust me.

32:50.960 --> 32:52.960
I'm going to take
good care of you, my son.

32:53.040 --> 32:54.080
Good boy.

32:59.120 --> 33:00.160
No fever.

33:01.920 --> 33:03.520
Are you daydreaming again?

33:07.360 --> 33:08.240
Su Chengcheng!

33:11.360 --> 33:12.880
Why are you so angry early in the morning?

33:12.960 --> 33:15.200
You just ruined my sweet dream!

33:16.080 --> 33:17.080
What did I do?

33:17.160 --> 33:19.400
Look at yourself in the mirror!

33:51.920 --> 33:52.760
The filter upgraded?

34:09.719 --> 34:10.719
What's the new function?

34:13.719 --> 34:17.639
3D CREATION, NEW

34:18.280 --> 34:21.040
2D to 3D creation?

34:23.080 --> 34:24.800
What does it mean?

34:28.040 --> 34:32.400
When it upgraded last time,
the function was 3D printing.

34:33.120 --> 34:36.120
And this is 3D creation.

34:36.199 --> 34:38.639
It's 2D to 3D creation.

34:43.480 --> 34:46.159
I get it. It's like an imitation show.

34:46.239 --> 34:49.239
Whether it's Su Miao, Wukong, or Alpaca,

34:49.320 --> 34:53.040
it's just an imitation printed
by the filter.

34:53.120 --> 34:55.040
It looks exactly like the original figure.

34:55.800 --> 34:58.120
Now it's creation.

34:58.200 --> 35:01.360
You can create something
that doesn't exist in the 3D world.

35:10.600 --> 35:12.680
Come on. Try this one.

35:15.520 --> 35:16.360
Fang Jin!

35:17.160 --> 35:21.000
We're finally back to normal lives!

35:21.080 --> 35:23.920
I've tidied up my new house.
I'll move today.

35:24.880 --> 35:26.760
I can go to work!
